# The site calls the API at /api. In development Vite forwards /api to http://127.0.0.1:3001
# (the scalric-website-backend project), so no variables are needed here.

# Production: full origin of the deployed backend (no trailing slash). Leave unset in development.
# On Vercel set it under Project > Settings > Environment Variables, then redeploy (it is inlined at build time).
# VITE_API_URL=https://your-backend.example.com
